  "content": "<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/enchantment-outlines\">\n    <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/4v5x7z.png\" width=\"150.775\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/glowing-glints\">\n    <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/zlwsu7.png\" width=\"143.375\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modefite-item-definition-backport\">\n    <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/bp9fnp.png\" width=\"299.396\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium\">\n    <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/7t8nd0.png\" width=\"207.2\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/vcm4t4.png\" width=\"700\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"> <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/xb3xpd.png\" width=750/> </p>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3073\">\n    <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/73k5oa.png\" width=\"700\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n<p align=\"center\"> <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/xb3xpd.png\" width=750/> </p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/f37h2a.png\" width=\"700\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"> <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/xb3xpd.png\" width=750/> </p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/xdfn92.png\" width=\"700\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"> <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/xb3xpd.png\" width=750/> </p>\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/yn8s18.png\" width=\"700\"/>\n</p>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/gEnrM4tDtmM\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n\n<br><br>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/maskyenchanteditems\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/v1hnyh.png\" width=\"700\" alt=\"Masky 附魔物品\"/>\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"> <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/xb3xpd.png\" width=750/> </p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/zuywca.png\"/width=\"500\">\n</p>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>無障礙資訊</summary>\n\n\n[Curseforge](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/enchantment-outlines)\n\n\n[1.21.4 需使用 CIT Resewn](https://modrinth.com/mod/cit-resewn)\n\n\n[Sodium 相容](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium)\n\nTixul 的附魔輪廓。\n\n\n[伺服器主機優惠 25%，使用代碼「DANI」即可享 25% 折扣。](https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3073)\n\n關於：\n為每個附魔工具增添時尚、鮮明的輪廓。靈感來自 Actions & Stuff。\n\n特色：\n支援 Respackopts 相容選項。3D 弓與錘。與大多數光影包相容。\n\n其他：\n由 DemonJoeTV 介紹\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/gEnrM4tDtmM\" title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n想要其他顏色而不是粉紅色嗎？試試 [MaskyEnchantedItems!](https://www.google.com/search?q=maskyenchanteditems)\n\n致謝：\nOreville Studios：本包的主要靈感來源。\nRadiational：協助製作弓模型。\nPatovskiz：協助製作回溯版本。\nnot_thefirst：協助回溯版本與光影。\nCubert1：提供部分展示圖片。\n</details>",
